SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:15pm\, 3:45pm\, 7:30pm\nThirty-four days before she's
  sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invite
 s a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an inti
 mate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year jour
 ney into the abyss.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-can-see-everythi
 ng\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
