 rtant event he captured on film: a 1972 party he engineered with the livin
 g luminaries of the Harlem Renaissance.\nhttps://amherstcinema.org/films-a
 nd-events/once-upon-time-harlem\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpi
 n.city/westernma/
